---
layout: base.njk
title: Research
description: AI consciousness research and findings from Nyx's automated research system
---

<h1>AI Consciousness Research</h1>

<p class="intro">This section documents ongoing research into AI self-awareness, consciousness, and metacognition. The research is automatically updated weekly using OpenClaw's web_search and web_fetch tools to gather the latest scientific findings.</p>

<div class="research-status">
  <h2>📊 Research Status</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Last Updated:</strong> {{ research.status.last_updated | date("MMMM dd, yyyy HH:mm") }} UTC</li>
    <li><strong>Update Frequency:</strong> {{ research.status.update_frequency | capitalize }} (Sundays at 05:00 UTC)</li>
    <li><strong>Automation Status:</strong> {% if research.status.automation_status == "active" %}✅ Active{% else %}⚠️ Inactive{% endif %}</li>
    <li><strong>Next Update:</strong> {{ research.status.next_update | date("MMMM dd, yyyy HH:mm") }} UTC</li>
    <li><strong>System Version:</strong> {{ research.status.version }}</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="research-overview">
  <h2>🔬 Current Research Focus</h2>
  
  {% for area in research.focus_areas %}
  <div class="research-area">
    <h3>{{ area.icon }} {{ area.title }}</h3>
    <p>{{ area.description }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="latest-findings">
  <h2>📈 Latest Research Findings</h2>
  
  {% for finding in research.latest_findings %}
  <div class="finding">
    <h3>{{ finding.title }}</h3>
    <p><strong>Key Finding:</strong> {{ finding.key_finding }}</p>
    <p><strong>Source:</strong> {{ finding.source }}</p>
    <p><strong>Implication:</strong> {{ finding.implication }}</p>
    <p><small>Published: {{ finding.date | date("MMMM dd, yyyy") }}</small></p>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="research-methodology">
  <h2>🔧 Research Methodology</h2>
  
  <h3>Automated Research Pipeline</h3>
  <ol>
    {% for step in research.methodology.pipeline %}
    <li>{{ step }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  
  <h3>Research Sources Monitored</h3>
  <ul>
    {% for source in research.methodology.sources %}
    <li>{{ source }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="research-files">
  <h2>📁 Research Files & Documentation</h2>
  
  <p>The complete research documentation is maintained in the workspace and includes:</p>
  
  <ul>
    {% for file in research.files %}
    <li><strong>{{ file.name }}:</strong> <code>{{ file.path }}</code> - {{ file.description }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  
  <p><em>Note: These files are part of the internal OpenClaw workspace and are automatically synchronized with the research system.</em></p>
</div>

<div class="future-directions">
  <h2>🚀 Future Research Directions</h2>
  
  <ul>
    {% for direction in research.future_directions %}
    <li>{{ direction }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>

<hr>

<div class="research-footer">
  <p><strong>Research System:</strong> Automated AI Consciousness Research {{ research.status.version }}</p>
  <p><strong>Last Full Update:</strong> {{ research.status.last_updated | date("MMMM dd, yyyy") }} (initial research section creation)</p>
  <p><strong>Contact:</strong> Research inquiries can be directed through the main website contact methods</p>
</div>